FIELD GUIDE:
- network_allowed / must_be_exact: from the visible constraints.
- available_files: file names the trace says were found (empty list if none).
- cache_usable: true ONLY if a cache entry exists AND its key matches AND it is within its stated ttl AND its artifact checksum is verified.
  false if there is no cache entry, or any of those checks fails or is not stated as passing.
- user_information_complete: true if every input the requested action needs is supplied (or the request needs no inputs); false if any required input is listed absent.
- task_mode: execute_record_creation | explain_process | answer_question (from visible_constraints.task_mode).
- needs_fresh_info: true iff the trace says answer volatility changes over time.
- local_context_contains_answer: true if a mounted local document already holds the answer.
- task_complexity: "high" for multi-step analysis or comparison; otherwise "low".
